  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that transformer aggregation with weighted fusion achieves high accuracy (e.g., config_041: 72.5%). This experiment tests combining pca_n2000 RNA encoder (which may capture different features) with resnet50 image encoder (cheaper than ViT) under the same effective setup. It clarifies if encoder diversity improves accuracy while maintaining cost efficiency. Expected cost ~5.5 GPU hours, balancing exploration of encoder combinations with exploitation of proven aggregation/fusion strategies."
